# 14. Financial Lifecycle

Use a controlled state machine.

Example:

```text
PENDING
   ↓
ELIGIBLE
   ↓
SELECTED
   ↓
APPROVED
   ↓
DISBURSED
   ↓
UTILIZATION_PENDING
   ↓
VERIFIED
   ↓
SETTLED
```

Invalid state transitions must be rejected.

Financial operations must be transaction-safe.

